    "Deep opaque reflected illumination and same-colour subject/background remain ambiguous; no universal photographic correction claim.",
    "Finite coarse-guided F/B relaxation can stall at a box boundary and is not proven converged; native-full-resolution spatial F/B recovery is not implemented.",
